  <item>
    <title>Vol015:吹牛老爹那点事.（上集）Didi，Baby,嘻哈故事会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671a08f40d2f24f28985ec4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671a08f40d2f24f28985ec4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Oct 2024 08:44:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘿！今天我又改形式了！其实初衷还是放点歌。但是要有故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>大洋彼岸如此热闹，我们不凑，也得知道吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天开始按照我自己对于新闻和以前报章杂志的理解，聊一下震惊全球的大案嫌疑人Sean Combs(吹牛老爹)的一些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 《I Will Be Missing You》Puff Daddy feat. Faith Evans, 112</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> &nbsp;《Young G's》Puff Daddy feat. The Notorious B.I.G. &amp; Jay-Z</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> &nbsp;《Come To Me》 Puff Daddy feat. Nicole Scherzinger</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> &nbsp;《is it you》 Cassie Vantura</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1924">32:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;《Baby》 &nbsp;Justin Bieber</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《Yeah!》Asher</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2497">41:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;《Heal The World》Michael Jackson</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqsIwxyxmqljG-xeAhSNp3RN__pe.m4a" length="46567872" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsG0ef121VcTv0VtD5xhgRUh260E.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol：014 上海话闲聊，听歌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670cb9360d2f24f289f4263c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670cb9360d2f24f289f4263c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 06:24:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期是我10期间开着手机录了和我老婆，和我几个朋友聊天的内容，那天笑得很开怀。我也想让大家都开心一下。中间还插了几首国语歌曲，都是那天我们之后KTV点的歌。曾经我们几个都是KTV的歌王</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果不想听闲聊没关系，我把歌的时间点标出来直接听。我的音乐LEVEL你们懂的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">00:03:42</a> 《我和我的祖国》王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">00:06:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">00:11:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;《偷心》张学友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">00:15:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1246">00:20:46</a> &nbsp;《鲜花》回春丹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">00:22:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1668">00:27:48</a> &nbsp;《爱人错过》告五人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">00:31:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">00:33:53</a> &nbsp;《罗马表》布衣乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">00:39:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">00:43:34</a> &nbsp;《决战二世祖》侧田</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">00:46:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">00:51:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;《大会堂演奏厅》李克勤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">00:54:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3558">00:59:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;《给自己的歌》李宗盛</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是上集，可能还有下集，可能没有</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近我小宇宙开始有黑粉了，因为我的善良反而激怒了这些网蛆。这种人这辈子只能生活在阴暗里。而我天天过的可开心了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我会做一个新的内容，结合我了解的音乐做一个音乐专辑。欢迎订阅</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljGFDY-Uc723OeIhy_4zJ-Azam5a.m4a" length="57545215" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvpLGoW5sPnG1yVbNagnUFCQJayK.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
